Package: kairos-gui
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCHITECTURE@
Maintainer: Paranoid Zero <dev@kairoschain.org>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.35), libgcc-s1, xdg-desktop-portal
Homepage: https://kairoschain.org/
Description: Native Kairos wallet
 Kairos wallet with its private, locally supervised full node.
 Wallet data remains in the user's home directory when the package is removed.
